## 8. Explicit non-goals for this phase

Do **not**:
- Implement real WebSocket exchange connectivity, CCXT order placement, or anything resembling the "Quantum Edge" / HERMES real-execution blueprint from `docs/Full context.md` §9 — this phase is paper-simulation only, on a polling schedule, exactly like backtesting but continuous.
