- Touch presets, marketplace, or notifications.
- Change how historical/paper/walk-forward/Monte-Carlo *backtests* behave — Task 2's refactor must be behavior-preserving for those, verified manually.
- Support more than one symbol per live bot, or multiple concurrent live sessions per bot (the partial unique index enforces the latter).

